# Documentation discipline

- Update `docs/telemetry/event-catalog.md` when adding analytics events.
- Mirror external framework facts into `external-docs/` with `SOURCE.md` provenance.
- Keep `context-map/README.md` routing order current if new memory layers appear.
- BookStack runbooks: link from `docs/bookstack/onboarding-structure.md` when creating new sections.
